span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">선발대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">정규학기 재학 중인 대학생 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">322</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">명</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">공고 기준일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">(2023.8.24.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">)) </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">현재 학생 또는 부모의 주민등록 주소지가 인천</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">인천 소재 고등학교를 졸업한 귀 교에 재학중인 학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 40pt; text-indent: -40pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">선발분야 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">총 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">종</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 40pt; text-indent: -40pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">희망드림</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">(166), </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">응원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">(14), </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">관외대학 거주비 지원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">(100), </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">공익인재</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">(18), SK</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">행복</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">(24) </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">장학금</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">응시자격 및 지원내용 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">: </span><u><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">선발공고문 및 재단 장학금 신청 페이지</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">(www.itle.or.kr)</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">참고</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">    </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">장학생 선발분야 별 상이</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">접수기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">: </span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weig